From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.media.mediacontrol: IAudioStateMonitor and the parameterless Create*AudioStateMonitor

Adds audio.idl (IAudioStateMonitor, AudioStateMonitorSoundLevel, as documented
for audiostatemonitorapi.h; local to this DLL) and the monitor object: idle
sound level Full, RegisterCallback hands out unique non-zero handles (callbacks
are never called: nothing lowers streams here), UnregisterCallback is quiet
for unknown handles. CreateCaptureAudioStateMonitor and
CreateRenderAudioStateMonitor return one.

---
diff --git a/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/Makefile.in b/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/Makefile.in
index 099ab5d..d71e4d0 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/Makefile.in
@@ -2,6 +2,8 @@ MODULE  = windows.media.mediacontrol.dll
 IMPORTS = combase
 
 SOURCES = \
+	audio.idl \
+	audiostate.c \
 	classes.idl \
 	main.c \
 	vector.c
diff --git a/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/audio.idl b/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/audio.idl
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..53cac60
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/windows.media.mediacontrol/audio.idl
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
